{"availability":"available","full":"Arash-Alborz/belgian_legal_retrieval","name":"belgian_legal_retrieval","description":"A multilingual retrieval system for Belgian law articles using dense retrieval, FAISS indexing, and cross-encoder reranking.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-27T07:14:04Z","updated":"2026-04-28T07:49:11Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Arash-Alborz/dutch-legal-search","topics":["belgian-law","dutch-language","dutch-nlp","embeddings","english-nlp","faiss-vector-database","fine-tuning","german-nlp","gradio","huggingface-datasets","huggingface-transformers","indexed-db","legal-ai","multilingual-nlp","optimization","rag","reranking","retrieval-systems","sentence-transformers","translation"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Arash-Alborz/dutch-legal-search","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:50:50.195Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:50:50.195Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:50:50.195Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:14:50.687Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:32:05.126Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:50:50.195Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project implements a semantic search system over Belgian statutory law articles (bBSARD dataset) using dense retrieval, FAISS indexing, and cross-encoder reranking. The system supports multilingual queries (English, German, Dutch) through automatic translation. The bBSARD dataset includes both Dutch and French, however for this project only the Dutch subset was used.","The pipeline consists of three main components:","A fine-tuned SentenceTransformer model maps queries and documents into a shared embedding space. Base model sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 shows weak retrieval, however fine-tuning improved the retrieval. Although the model is very small, it shows promissing retrieval abilities (see evaluation)."],"features":["Dense Retrieval (Bi-Encoder)","Reranking (Cross-Encoder)","Multilingual Support"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Arash-Alborz/belgian_legal_retrieval/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"46c0cd24f34f663bbf8a8d1b8a5e87156260abc505f979b47829ece205c90d21","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:50.831Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:50.831Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This project implements a semantic search system over Belgian statutory law articles (bBSARD dataset) using dense retrieval, FAISS indexing, and cross-encoder reranking. The system supports multilingual queries (English, German, Dutch) through automatic translation. The bBSARD dataset includes both Dutch and French, however for this project only the Dutch subset was used.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Arash-Alborz/belgian_legal_retrieval/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"46c0cd24f34f663bbf8a8d1b8a5e87156260abc505f979b47829ece205c90d21","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Arash-Alborz/belgian_legal_retrieval/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:50.831Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-04-28T07:49:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Arash-Alborz/belgian_legal_retrieval/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:50.832Z","hash":"46c0cd24f34f663bbf8a8d1b8a5e87156260abc505f979b47829ece205c90d21","originalBytes":6127,"storedBytes":6127,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:50.687Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRequired":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Arash-Alborz/dutch-legal-search","attemptedAt":"2026-10-14T22:06:38.784Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,